<title>UK: Denmark sets 500 million mark five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Denmark sets 500 million mark five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers SBC Warburg and Nomura.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DENMARK</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.0 PCT   MATURITY    16.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.09    PAY DATE    16.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0 PCT   REOFFER    99.34     SPREAD	+17 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    FFT/LUX   PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.75</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
